## Problem classes

### `Hub session cannot see product repos`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| Claude refuses to read `/Users/.../backend` from the hub | `additionalDirectories` missing or stale | Update hub `.claude/settings.json`; relaunch Claude from the hub |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->

### `Personal skill shadows the pack`

| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| ------- | ----- | --- |
| `/grill-me` runs an old copy | Personal `~/.claude/skills/grill-me` overrides project; leftover copy vs symlink | Remove the extra copy; symlink back to this repo's `skills/grill-me` |

<!-- last-verified: 2026-09 -->
